                <ul>
                  <li>
                    Delivering features in an internal open contribution model to more than a dozen client applications
                    and libraries in <strong>React Native</strong>, <strong>TypeScript</strong>, and
                    <strong>JavaScript</strong>.
                  </li>
                  <li>Releasing new versions of our applications "over-the-air".</li>
                  <li>
                    Providing teams with high-level strategy on delivering business outcomes. This includes technical
                    decomposition of business goals into features, release/publishing coordination, and working closely
