                  </li>
                  <li>
                    Ensuring quality through unit- and component testing with <strong>Jest</strong>, and working with
                    our quality engineers to maintain automation and CI/CD pipelines.
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    Translating specs from data analytics teams, implementing telemetry functionality, and leveraging
                    big data tools like <strong>Imply</strong> to monitor application health.
                  </li>
